      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he ðonne borh næbbe, slea man hine ⁊ hine on ful lecge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he has no surety, he shall be slain and buried in unconsecrated ground.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne borh næbbe, slea mon hine ⁊ on ful lecge.</ab>
